  "cards": [
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 28,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated and compassionate veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently praise clinicians including Dr. Manrique, Dr. Seng, Dr. Ojala, and Dr. Sanchez alongside the technical staff for their warmth, competence, and supportive bedside manner. Reviewers highlight how team members listen carefully to owner concerns and collaborate on complex treatment plans. With few isolated grievances, clients describe the staff as deeply trustworthy."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Calming care for sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers commend the clinic's gentle approach with anxious cats, high-energy puppies, and senior dogs. Clients note that technicians take time to help pets acclimate and minimize clinic stress during wellness exams and blood draws. Owners of nervous animals appreciate the fear-free environment, observing that their pets feel comfortable and safe throughout their appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Efficient check-ins and flexible scheduling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners generally report prompt intake, convenient operating hours, and minimal time spent in the waiting room. Many clients appreciate how quickly veterinarians accommodate acute medical concerns and urgent walk-in needs. While one reviewer noted a long wait with a sick puppy, most pet parents describe the appointment flow and scheduling process as remarkably smooth."
      }
    }
  ],
